---
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-orange-500/15 text-white relative">
  <div class="space-y-10">
    
    <!-- Clean Section Header (GSAP Reveal) -->
    <div class="space-y-2 section-header">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/25 text-orange-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-400"></span>
        <span>Kasbiy faoliyat</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Men haqimda
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl">
        Algoritmik tafakkur, dasturlash va pedagogik mahorat uyg‘unligi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Asymmetric Bento Grid (GSAP Tilt & Reveal) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Bento Item 1: Biography (Span 8) -->
      <div class="reveal-card tilt-card md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 cyber-card p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-5 bg-[#08080e]/90 border-orange-500/20">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            Kasbiy qiyofa va faoliyat yo‘nalishim
          </h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Men — <strong class="text-white font-bold">Shamsiddinov Muxiddin Xusniddin o‘g‘li</strong>, O‘zbekistonning Sirdaryo viloyatida faoliyat olib boruvchi IT mutaxassisi, dasturchi va pedagogman. Asosiy e’tiborim <span class="text-orange-400 font-semibold">veb-dasturlash</span>, <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">Aiogram 3 asosidagi Telegram botlar</span> va yoshlarga dasturlashni tizimli o‘rgatishga qaratilgan.
            </p>
            <p>
              Hozirda Guliston shahridagi <strong class="text-white border-b border-orange-500/50 pb-0.5">Rich Boss xususiy maktabida</strong> bo‘lajak dasturchilarga dars berib kelmoqdaman. O‘quvchilarga quruq nazariyani emas, balki real muammolarga zamonaviy algoritmik yechim yaratish metodikasini o‘rgataman.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Badges -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-orange-500/15">
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/25 text-orange-300 font-medium">
            Rich Boss IT Ustozi
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/25 text-amber-300 font-medium">
            GDPI Talabasi (4-kurs)
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/25 text-emerald-300 font-medium">
            Sirdaryo IKMT Maxsus Fan O‘qituvchisi
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 2: Education (Span 4) -->
      <div class="reveal-card tilt-card md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 cyber-card p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 bg-[#08080e]/90 border-orange-500/20">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-orange-500/15 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400">
                <path d="M12 3L1 9l4 2.18v6L12 21l7-3.82v-6l2-1.09V17h2V9L12 3zm6.82 6L12 12.72 5.18 9 12 5.28 18.82 9zM17 15.99l-5 2.73-5-2.73v-3.72L12 15l5-2.73v3.72z"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Ta'lim</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 bg-amber-500/15 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30">
              4-kurs
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-white">Guliston davlat pedagogika instituti</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Aniq va tabiiy fanlar fakulteti</p>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/20 text-xs text-slate-200 mt-2">
              <span class="text-orange-400 font-semibold">Yo‘nalish:</span> Matematika va informatika (Bakalavriat)
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 pt-1">
              Matematik analiz, diskret matematika, ma'lumotlar tuzilmasi va pedagogik texnologiyalar.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 pt-3 border-t border-orange-500/15 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Qabul: 2023-yil</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Bitiruv: 2026-yil</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 3: Languages (Span 5) -->
      <div class="reveal-card tilt-card md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 cyber-card p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-4 bg-[#08080e]/90 border-orange-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-orange-500/15">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400">
              <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Til bilish darajasi</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Ko‘rsatkich</span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Uzbek -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold">
              <span class="text-white">O‘zbek tili</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">Ona tili (Native)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-2 w-full bg-[#14141c] rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-orange-500/20">
              <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-emerald-400 rounded-full w-full"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Turkish -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold">
              <span class="text-white">Turk tili</span>
              <span class="text-orange-400">B2 Daraja (Erkin)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-2 w-full bg-[#14141c] rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-orange-500/20">
              <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-amber-400 rounded-full w-[85%]"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- English & Russian -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold">
              <span class="text-white">Ingliz & Rus tili</span>
              <span class="text-amber-300">Texnik IT & Hujjatlar</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-2 w-full bg-[#14141c] rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-orange-500/20">
              <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-300 rounded-full w-[70%]"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 4: Philosophy & Technical Interests (Span 7) -->
      <div class="reveal-card tilt-card md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 cyber-card p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 bg-[#08080e]/90 border-orange-500/20">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400">
              <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Dasturlash falsafam va apparat bilimlari</span>
          </h3>

          <blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 italic leading-relaxed mb-3 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0e0e16] border-l-2 border-orange-500">
            "Men uchun dasturlash — faqat kod yozish emas. Bu murakkab muammoni tahlil qilish, optimal apparat samaradorligiga erishish va insonlar uchun qulay raqamli vositalar barpo etishdir."
          </blockquote>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Dasturiy ta’limdan tashqari, <strong>zamonaviy CPU/GPU arxitekturasi</strong>, apparat resurslarini tezlashtirish, veb-dizayn va axborot xavfsizligi bo‘yicha chuqur amaliy qiziqishlarga egaman.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-orange-500/15 text-xs">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/20 text-slate-300">
            CPU & GPU Arxitekturasi
          </span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/20 text-slate-300">
            UI / UX Dizayn
          </span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#0e0e16] border border-orange-500/20 text-slate-300">
            Aiogram Asinxron Botlar
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
